\tvar f = FileAccess.open(destination_path, FileAccess.WRITE)\r\n\tf.store_buffer(source_file.data)\r\n\tf.close()\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou can use this sample code to copy the file `res://music.mp3` to any path selected by the user.\r\n\r\nBut please note that questions like this are better suited for the Godot community servers or the official forum: https://godotengine.org/community/","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706933768/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707169374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112215#issuecomment-3707169374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112215","id":3707169374,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c9upe","user":{"login":"procs6166-source","id":252697797,"node_id":"U_kgDODw_cxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252697797?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source","html_url":"https://github.com/procs6166-source","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/procs6166-source/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":